<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Computer Science Glossary</title>
    <style>
        body {
            font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
            background: #f4f2ff;
            padding: 25px;
        }
        .container {
            max-width: 900px;
            margin: auto;
            background: white;
            padding: 25px;
            border-radius: 16px;
        }
        h1 { text-align: center; color: #6040a6; }
        .entry {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: 160px 1fr;
            gap: 15px;
            padding: 16px;
            margin: 12px 0;
            background: #f1edff;
            border-radius: 10px;
        }
        .term { font-weight: bold; color: #6040a6; }
        @media (max-width: 500px) {
            .entry { grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 5px; }
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
<div class="container">
    <h1>📘 Computer Science Glossary</h1>

    <div class="entry">
        <div class="term">Algorithm</div>
        <div>A sequence of steps for solving a problem.</div>
    </div>

    <div class="entry">
        <div class="term">Data Structure</div>
        <div>A way to organize and store data for efficient use.</div>
    </div>

    <div class="entry">
        <div class="term">Operating System</div>
        <div>System software that manages computer resources.</div>
    </div>

    <div class="entry">
        <div class="term">Database</div>
        <div>An organized collection of related information.</div>
    </div>

    <div class="entry">
        <div class="term">Network</div>
        <div>A group of connected devices that can exchange data.</div>
    </div>

    <div class="entry">
        <div class="term">Source Code</div>
        <div>Instructions written by a programmer in a programming language.</div>
    </div>

    <div class="entry">
        <div class="term">Interface</div>
        <div>A point of interaction between a user or system and another system.</div>
    </div>

    <div class="entry">
        <div class="term">Debugging</div>
        <div>The process of locating and correcting software defects.</div>
    </div>
</div>
</body>
</html>
